      },
      "description": "TOP ROW ON PURPOSE: a spike here means the escalation guarantee (nobody answers in 60s -> SMS) is silently broken. Each point is increase() over $__rate_interval (Min step 15s = the scrape interval), so a counter restart cannot extrapolate a phantom spike. The dashboard time range still shows every failure in the window. Investigate BullMQ failed jobs + `pm2 logs worker`.",
