      "description": "PENDING (waiting for a warden) vs ACKNOWLEDGED (someone responded) vs RESOLVED. Refreshed every 15s from a Prisma groupBy exposed as alerts_by_status. The gauge is DB-wide and every API instance exports the same value, so the panel aggregates with max by (status): sum() would multiply each count by the number of running instances (3).",
